{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-11_end",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-11",
  "title": "突圍",
  "storyCode": "0-11",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-11_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f902c472572a293a6ca7cee7ee4eb0eed36f12d3d768b62d419a2c0ddbbf9526",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偵查完畢，確認敵追擊部隊已被我方全殲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們成功突圍，現在已經基本脫離了切爾諾伯格上城區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我們消滅的，只是包圍陣勢中一小部分的兵力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但至少，我們暫時安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你剛才的援助，臨光不會忘記這份恩情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請別這麼說。我可沒資格讓耀騎士還我人情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說說剛才那個狙擊手吧，臨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除卻那把弩炮巨大的威力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我認為......他可能預設了其他火力點，以及自動射擊器械。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我遭到了交叉火力的射擊......我們卻只觀測到了一個狙擊手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也有同樣感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一發彈藥和第二發彈藥爆炸的時間點雖然非常接近，實際上卻有著有相當微妙的時差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那並不是連射弩弦的功勞。至少，我發動火力壓制時，對抗的，並不是第一位狙擊手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你意識到了什麼，Ace？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不準。如果敵人不是飛速地移動......就是同時存在於許多地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵人狙擊手的機動性......怎麼也不可能達到這種程度。我不能想像這樣的移動手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動比我認知中更加危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那個兇狠的臭小子下令狙擊你的。他在指揮圍攻我們的時候，甚至沒動用狙擊手的力量......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來那麼惡劣的性格，是有同樣危險的力量支撐著的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他一直沒有出手，哪怕是在暴怒的情況下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要嘛，在戰鬥上他是個廢物；要嘛，現在還不到他展現實力的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，他展現出的指揮能力......已經很令人懷疑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的部隊，就像是完全被他操縱著一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，我們已經脫離了他的控制區域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨光......謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有你及時趕到的話，我們很可能就要深陷危機了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這都是我們戰前的作戰計畫的方針而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我和Ace他根據局勢採取不同計畫的，是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你解決了自己的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一路上，我看到了整合運動的暴行，也對他們的實力產生過懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我在那時，停下來去與他們戰鬥呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我去幫助烏薩斯人抵禦整合運動呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我原地堅守，只是等著你們撤退到我面前呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——如果按照我自己的想法來做，也許會招致更糟的後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不擅長預見，不斷戰鬥是我達到目的的方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，阿米婭，你有自己解決危機的實力，而我只是履行了自己的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是你透過自身努力摘下的果實，再自信點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨光小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身邊這位，就是博士了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我們每遇到一個人就要和她說說博士失憶了的事，這也太麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的一個朋友同樣也失去了記憶，你一定會和她很合得來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟對於你來說，沒有什麼比“現在”更重要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們，還要把博士護送到羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_5"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起......我失手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不要道歉。是我的錯，我太衝動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能幫我追蹤羅德島他們嗎？我會去把情況通報給塔露拉姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她應該也已經壓制住了切爾諾伯格的核心指揮塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——就讓她來決定這些蟲子的生死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心點，優先保護好自己，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "speakerId": "char_1508_Faust",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的任務也完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同胞們，該走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "speakerId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去迎接屬於我們的時代吧！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
